@startuml

actor Developer
actor Analyst

participant "Data Generator" as DG
participant "Ingestion Service (ETL)" as ING
participant "Validation Layer" as VAL
participant "FX Service" as FX
participant "Liquidity Engine (Spark Job)" as LE

database "PostgreSQL (System of Record)" as PG
database "Elasticsearch (Query / Search Index)" as ES

participant "Reporting / API Layer" as API

== Data Generation ==

Developer -> DG : Generate synthetic transactions
DG --> ING : batch transaction dataset

== Ingestion & Validation ==

ING -> VAL : Validate + clean records
VAL --> ING : validated transactions

== Persistence (Source of Truth) ==

ING -> PG : write raw + cleaned transactions
PG --> ING : ack

== FX Normalization ==

ING -> FX : convert to base currency (USD)
FX --> ING : normalized transactions

ING -> PG : store USD-normalized transactions
PG --> ING : ack

== Indexing Layer ==

ING -> ES : index transactions (search optimized docs)
ES --> ING : index confirmed

== Liquidity Computation ==

ING -> LE : send normalized dataset

LE -> LE : compute inflows/outflows
LE -> LE : rolling 30-day liquidity
LE -> PG : persist aggregated metrics
PG --> LE : ack

LE -> ES : index liquidity metrics (for fast dashboards)
ES --> LE : ack

== Serving Layer ==

Analyst -> API : request dashboard / query

API -> ES : query transactions + metrics
ES --> API : fast aggregated results

API --> Analyst : dashboard response

@enduml